# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Track all experiment artifacts for sharing via git.
# Note: we still keep global ignores (e.g. *.log/*.txt) for other folders,
# but explicitly un-ignore everything under experiment_results/.
# Re-ignore bulky logs and text dumps under experiment_results/ (GitHub 100MB limit).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!experiment_results/
!experiment_results/**
experiment_results/**/*.log
experiment_results/**/*.txt
!experiment_results/**/pruning_search_log.txt
